      "text": "{\"first_name\": \"Jianhua\", \"last_name\": \"Wang\", \"contact_id\": \"0eaff34d30d64a21ada0f969526ded6b\", \"is_user\": \"False\", \"gender\": \"Gender.MALE\", \"age\": \"68\", \"nationality\": \"Chinese\", \"city_living\": \"Shanghai\", \"country\": \"China\", \"status\": \"Status.RETIRED\", \"job\": \"Former High School History Teacher\", \"description\": \"Jianhua Wang is a proud and supportive father of Ridho Syuhada, his only child. He was born and raised in Shanghai, China, and has lived there his entire life. Jianhua is a retired high school history teacher, having spent 35 years educating young minds about the rich history of China. He is a kind and gentle soul, loved by his family, friends, and former students alike. Jianhua is an avid gardener and takes great pride in his small garden, where he grows a variety of herbs and vegetables. He is also a skilled calligrapher and enjoys practicing this traditional Chinese art form in his free time. Cooking is another one of Jianhua's passions, and he loves to experiment with new recipes in the kitchen.\", \"phone\": \"+862162395678\", \"email\": \"jianhua.wang1964@gaia2mail.com\", \"address\": \"345 Lane 123, Wukang Road, Xuhui District, Shanghai, 200031\"}",
